# Gym Membership Management SaaS

## Tech Stack
- Next.js 16 App Router
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS v4
- Prisma ORM
- PostgreSQL (Neon)
- Auth.js v5

## Rules
- Never use JavaScript.
- Never redesign completed pages.
- Reuse existing components.
- Preserve business logic.
- Mobile-first responsive.
- Production-ready code only.
- Ask before changing database schema.
- Never delete files unless requested.
- Never run npm run build unless requested.